wers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-17T14:17:12Z","updated_at":"2025-04-17T14:17:12Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2813099852/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2880610247","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105400#issuecomment-2880610247","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105400","id":2880610247,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rsp_H","user":{"login":"miv391","id":49998025,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTk4MDI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49998025?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391","html_url":"https://github.com/miv391","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-14T15:10:23Z","updated_at":"2025-05-14T15:10:23Z","body":"`oversampling=1` allowed me to make font pixelated. My game uses window size 640x360, `canvas_items` stretch mode with integer scaling. UI overlays are on `CanvasLayer`. My goal was to have UI text with pixelated font visually compatible with 640x360 pixel graphics. By default text is drawn using the native monitor resolution, whatever it is, so on 1440 or 4k monitor, the text is sharp and crisp. Using `oversampling=1` I managed to get the a pixelated font. Now it doesn't work anymore. What is the recommended way to have a pixelated font?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2880610247/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2884976468","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105400#issuecomment-2884976468","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105400","id":2884976468,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6r9T9U","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-15T20:26:41Z","updated_at":"2025-05-15T20:26:41Z","body":"> `oversampling=1` allowed me to make font pixelated. My game uses window size 640x360, `canvas_items` stretch mode with integer scaling. UI overlays are on `CanvasLayer`. My goal was to have UI text with pixelated font visually compatible with 640x360 pixel graphics. By default text is drawn using the native monitor resolution, whatever it is, so on 1440 or 4k monitor, the text is sharp and crisp. Using `oversampling=1` I managed to get the a pixelated font. Now it doesn't work anymore. What is the recommended way to have a pixelated font?\r\n\r\nYou can disable font oversampling in the Project Settings: `gui/fonts/dynamic_fonts/use_oversampling`","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2884976468/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2884985063","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105400#issuecomment-2884985063","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105400","id":2884985063,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6r9WDn","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-15T20:30:49Z","updated_at":"2025-05-15T20:30:49Z","body":"You can also disable or override it for a specific `Viewport` (or `Window`), using `oversampling` and `oversampling_override` properties.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2884985063/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2886351546","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105400#issuecomment-2886351546","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105400","id":2886351546,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sCjq6","user":{"login":"miv391","id":49998025,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTk4MDI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49998025?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391","html_url":"https://github.com/miv391","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-16T10:39:50Z","updated_at":"2025-05-16T10:39:50Z","body":"> You can also disable or override it for a specific `Viewport` (or `Window`), using `oversampling` and `oversampling_override` properties.\r\n\r\nViewport is the answer👍.  `SubViewportContainer / SubViewport / CanvasLayer / Label` structure works great in my case. Setting viewport size to the same 640x360 base resolution that my game uses and using Texture Filter `nearest` gets me a pixelated font even without meddling with the font oversampling.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2886351546/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]